---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Power Bank MOSFET Salvage | Lab | Wretzelectronics">
  <article class="lab-article">
    <header class="article-header">
      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag-badge">Teardown</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Power Electronics</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Component Salvage</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="article-title">Power Bank MOSFET Salvage</h1>
      <p class="article-tagline">Inspecting internal protection, charging, and boost circuitry.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
      <img
        src="/images/labs/lab-powerbank.png"
        alt="Broken power bank PCB teardown"
        class="hero-img"
      />
    </div>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Teardown & Analysis</h2>
      <p>
        This lab was a teardown experiment: I cracked open a commercial power bank to inspect its
        internals and attempt to salvage its MOSFETs. The board was far more modular and complex
        than expected, with tightly integrated charging, protection, and boost circuitry. Although
        none of the MOSFETs were usable for my project, the teardown offered a clear look at how
        consumer power banks manage battery safety and conversion.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lab-article {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .article-header {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .article-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .article-tagline {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    background: #000;
  }

  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>